WEBVTT

00:05:27.167 --> 00:05:30.059
kind of in the spirit and that facade

00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:33.809
very much corporate and federal style.

00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:35.726
And around that space,

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.268
the ring is actually galleries.

00:05:37.292 --> 00:05:39.893
Very, very difficult
to mount shows in there.

00:05:39.917 --> 00:05:41.851
When the Hirshhorn opened,

00:05:41.875 --> 00:05:44.161
Ada Louise Huxstable,
the New York Times critic,

00:05:44.185 --> 00:05:45.672
had some choice words:

00:05:45.696 --> 00:05:47.474
"Neo-penitentiary modern."

00:05:47.498 --> 00:05:50.333
"A maimed monument and a maimed Mall

00:05:50.357 --> 00:05:51.768
for a maimed collection."

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:53.524
Almost four decades later,

00:05:53.548 --> 00:05:55.268
how will this building expand

00:05:55.292 --> 00:05:57.297
for a new progressive program?

00:05:57.321 --> 00:05:58.809
Where would it go?

00:05:58.833 --> 00:06:00.051
It can't go in the Mall.